    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates are delighted to present No. 16 Burnaby Mill to the market.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented four-bedroom detached family home is superbly positioned within this highly regarded development in Greystones, Co. Wicklow.\r\nIdeally situated directly opposite a large, mature amenity green, the property enjoys an enviable open outlook to the front, while to the rear lies a private, south-facing garden, creating a wonderful sense of space and privacy.\r\n\r\nThe property has been thoughtfully extended and upgraded to an exceptionally high standard throughout. The undoubted centrepiece is the stunning vaulted-ceiling extension to the rear, creating an impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and living space. Bathed in natural light from a striking run of skylights, this exceptional room opens directly onto the rear garden, providing an ideal setting for both relaxed family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nA superbly converted attic provides valuable additional accommodation, offering excellent versatility as a guest suite, home office, playroom or teenager’s retreat. The space is further enhanced by its own en suite shower room.\r\n\r\nThroughout the ground floor, solid ash flooring adds warmth and elegance, complemented by two wood-burning stoves — one in the main sitting room and another within the kitchen extension — creating inviting and characterful reception spaces.\r\n\r\nTo the front, a cobble-lock driveway provides generous off-street parking for up to three cars and benefits from an EV charging point.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, high-quality finishes and a thoughtfully designed extension with a superb south-facing garden, No. 16 Burnaby Mill presents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a stylish and exceptionally well-appointed family home in one of Greystones’ most popular residential developments.\r\n\r\nGreystones town is within easy reach where all your needs will be catered for with a wonderful selection of bistros, boutiques, restaurants and shops, the village library, churches and a large number of highly regarded schools. \r\n\r\nA host of sport and leisure clubs abound in the area including the Shoreline Leisure Centre sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis and GAA to name but a few as well as a great choice of renowned golf clubs, including Greystones, Powerscourt and Druids Glen.\r\n\r\nThe commuter will be delighted at the easy access to local bus stops and DART and rail transport services, both within walking distance. \r\nThe N11/M50 is also within easy reach making for an easy commute to the city, airport and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nEngineered Ash wood flooring, decorative coving, carpeted stairs to landing, under stairs storage, WC and cloak room off.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nCarpeted flooring, decorative coving, wood burning stove with solid wood mantle, cast Iron and tile inset and slate hearth, double doors to dining room, bay window overlooking off street parking and amenity green.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room Engineered Ash wood flooring, fully fitted kitchen, floor and wall based storage cupboards, polished black Granite countertops, feature island unit with  inset stainless steel sink unit,  ample countertops, integrated appliances, x6 Velux window, feature Rangemaster stove with 5 ring gas hob, double glazed French doors to rear garden, picture window overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nTV Room \r\nEngineered Ash wood flooring, decorative coving, vertical radiator, double doors to extended kitchen/dining room, utility room off living room.\r\n\r\nUtility\r\nTiled flooring, plumbed and wired for washing machine and tumble dryer, floor and wall based storage  cupboards, stainless steel sink unit, ample countertops, external door to side passage.\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC  \r\nEngineered Ash wood flooring, WC, wall hung wash hand basin with under storage, exterior window.\r\n \r\nLanding\r\nCarpeted flooring, walk-in hot press off landing, carpeted stairs to attic, recess lighting. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nLaminated wood flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobe, overlooking amenity space, en-suite off.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nFully tiled, WC, wall hung wash hand basin with under storage and lighting, fully tiled double width shower unit with mains drench head and telephone hand shower, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nLaminated wood flooring, floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes, views overlooking rear garden. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nLaminated wood flooring, views overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\nLaminated wood flooring, built-in wardrobe, overlooking amenity green.\r\n\r\nAttic Landing\r\nCarpeted stairs to landing, \r\n\r\nAttic Room\r\nCarpeted flooring, additional eaves storage, 2x velux windows, en suite off.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nFully tiled, WC, wall hung wash hand basin with under storage and lighting, \r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nTiled flooring, part tiled walls, WC, wash hand basin with under storage, feature wall mirror, fully tiled shower cubical with Triton T90XR electric shower, external window.\r\n\r\nOutside Front\r\nLarge cobblelock driveway, parking for multiple cars, electrical charging point, mature hedging.\r\n\r\nOutside Rear\r\nBeautifully landscaped  garden with porcelain stone tiles and artificial grass, timber-framed garden shed, feature concrete raised flower beds with mature plants, Cedarwood panelling, exterior mood lighting, outdoor tap, solid timber gate side for side access."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Private cul de sac setting\r\nEnviable B BER rating\r\nBeautifully decorated and interior designed throughout\r\nSpacious Attic conversion with eaves storage\r\nImpressive open plan kitchen/dining/living room extension with vaulted ceilings\r\nExceptional kitchen with bespoke cabinetry and feature Island unit\r\nFeature Rangemaster stove with 5 ring gas hob\r\nProperty enjoys exceptional natural light enhanced by neutral decorative tones throughout\r\nNew A rated double glazed windows and doors\r\nLandscaped private south facing rear garden\r\nOverlooking amenity green\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nAmple off street parking for 3 vehicles"
      },
